            <div xml:id="m-cdc999e5-9503-450d-aa86-be4ceb4e6731">
              <lg xml:id="m-acd66e86-f48a-4011-a6b8-1a5f7be401b4">
                <l xml:id="m-fea1cc1d-d6a8-49f4-942c-01a3709c2299" facs="#m-950b209d-beb1-4df1-89c2-f91a39569ae4" label="ambiguous">Wednesday in Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-aae78f31-7adb-4ff8-872a-23b363dc046f" facs="#m-89883a86-3dd9-49cd-aeb1-8c4443f9d9f2" label="ambiguous">794</l><l xml:id="m-ee40ea81-68c8-474a-9651-ffdcaa5c17db" facs="#m-44593e01-24e7-4b87-8129-f7aa80eb3016" label="lyrics-like">virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee2912d2-d89d-480e-bf68-e2aa803b0097" facs="#m-b97a9def-c2ee-47f6-95ab-b571bf76cd31" label="lyrics-like">tem, déxtera Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-656f8211-06b9-41ae-aac1-7fdac276c3b9" facs="#m-c7d5d633-c287-4556-b426-3667a23f2b05" label="ambiguous">ex-al¬</l><l xml:id="m-35c0c5ba-2bea-43ea-9ef4-fe4a4e9e89b4" facs="#m-218b9232-a5a6-4d48-a44c-2214bba23f1f" label="lyrics-like">távit me.</l><l xml:id="m-02cc7cb8-c298-4323-90fd-9e1beb36389f" facs="#m-d7b8f562-dcdc-4f19-8e03-c12c7692c590" label="ambiguous">mini</l><l xml:id="m-7cf12eab-b2b0-42db-934b-455255b47637" facs="#m-d44b3d8b-94b0-4efe-9874-c23d01066184" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-0baaa0c7-67da-453f-8862-44960d0b4085" facs="#m-42fd47c8-4865-4d83-823d-ff9b08a7b662" label="ambiguous">H "</l><l xml:id="m-d04db7a4-53e7-42be-8e39-f1292a7d6980" facs="#m-d386f50e-af54-42fd-85f7-f0f69d1ce558" label="lyrics-like">V. Surré¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b0773b2-108b-4a55-88f7-7e51a384e342" facs="#m-3c62d1ed-c3f5-4f83-a354-efea0fa912a1" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-17774cbc-b57a-4a62-8ae5-62a36fffec08" facs="#m-1789482f-7aab-4e83-a39b-0e34094f30ca" label="ambiguous">xit</l><l xml:id="m-9352dc01-beaa-4893-b6f5-380774c2967f" facs="#m-b2c692ea-ba65-4540-9740-2c2e1b5ade7d" label="ambiguous">ii</l><l xml:id="m-a6c8dd2d-a3a9-4ea8-9ce7-a7bffb0de09a" facs="#m-103118bf-da51-4976-a045-b74019611195" label="ambiguous">4-</l><l xml:id="m-a25c51b0-7794-44e0-995f-31e12135e874" facs="#m-5440305b-8fac-498c-9ec1-fe6293048dd6" label="lyrics-like">Dó-minus ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-5560c625-f635-4a1e-95bb-8fd6d7edc6f8" facs="#m-942da87a-737a-46f8-9adf-ae3cc604330b" label="lyrics-like">páru-it</l><l xml:id="m-b963bb14-04bf-4afc-a3fa-976c6db484a4" facs="#m-11a6057e-f463-4c3a-9f96-b7249f86c9fd" label="ambiguous">re,</l><l xml:id="m-c992c5ea-25a6-471f-8905-0e4a82ef777a" facs="#m-4478bcb7-6ba2-408c-9843-1e6692d3fa9a" label="ambiguous">et ap¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d14a27b-74b3-430c-bca2-9407475aeefb" facs="#m-d4cdf3c2-26a8-4c31-a9d0-61af881e894e" label="lyrics-like">Pé-tro.</l><l xml:id="m-3c44073d-95f7-4c04-8ca7-f53f11bb9c2f" facs="#m-e6c4f478-df8e-4443-8d15-e946d7a599f8" label="lyrics-like">Sequence. Victimae Pascháli. with Allelúia at the end, p. 780.</l><l xml:id="m-46fb4f6a-a245-47bf-b772-7e9f906c8238" facs="#m-195ac6bf-4bd1-4e6b-a0fd-2b2b8d5c9d67" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 21.</l><l xml:id="m-efa53459-b61a-4056-9bf3-f80b7fd41bd7" facs="#m-9f1a86d6-8d4c-4fde-9c43-31cb9d7ba59d" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Manifestávit se est, túnica succinxit se (erat enim</l><l xml:id="m-5fd02291-9f8d-4f53-b70c-a315ff1f3b5d" facs="#m-09df178f-4102-4894-80f0-f9179e16680f" label="ambiguous">L iterum Jesus discipulis ad mare</l><l xml:id="m-9efd3e19-9593-4c76-af76-6977b83891e9" facs="#m-21d93bb3-ec08-415a-b773-09ef5bd2ca6d" label="ambiguous">nudus) et misit se in mare. Alii</l><l xml:id="m-bfc81ab7-6dac-42d4-a27d-6a364223cd56" facs="#m-823e321d-4b36-498f-b13d-8b974551590d" label="lyrics-like">Tiberiadis. Manifestávit autem sic:</l><l xml:id="m-44e5e16e-152a-463b-b93c-80cca061bd66" facs="#m-16f00f5b-5168-4549-8f82-4c57104d826f" label="lyrics-like">autem discipuli navígio venérunt</l><l xml:id="m-36f60ada-dd9a-49e7-be9f-04848b057cdd" facs="#m-e0e354a7-87ab-4b74-88af-e1731a6e50dd" label="ambiguous">Erant simul Simon Petrus, et Tho¬</l><l xml:id="m-56029a20-7af3-4f0f-8d9d-d94be8319e78" facs="#m-889f7126-e55c-48c6-99ba-199886094162" label="ambiguous">(non enim longe erant a terra, sed</l><l xml:id="m-6af7747b-dc17-4065-8b7f-a75635c60819" facs="#m-ab78db14-2b84-4b92-af0e-2af1c9f38780" label="ambiguous">mas, qui dicitur Didymus, et Na¬</l><l xml:id="m-d22d81cd-f68a-47a4-b2f4-d135f2ecc2e3" facs="#m-bb6857a6-ebfb-4a34-bc41-cf7388067233" label="lyrics-like">quasi cúbitis ducéntis), trahéntes</l><l xml:id="m-b1b933e8-f8dc-4dc5-b621-59f644b374e7" facs="#m-60333472-8f51-463f-8156-54409f2c4254" label="lyrics-like">thánaël, qui erat a Cana Galilaéae,</l><l xml:id="m-6758bf01-cc91-4d3c-a561-158576193a32" facs="#m-d72d46f6-ae75-4c2d-bba9-02fd012c3a54" label="lyrics-like">rete piscium. Ut ergo descendérunt</l><l xml:id="m-47821e8c-2556-40b3-82f7-3f7eabb931de" facs="#m-5dcec385-4505-4a29-aa3a-dcf80368e707" label="lyrics-like">et flii zebedaéi, et álii ex discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-e41012a0-baf4-4c77-95c3-8fb9142b8b21" facs="#m-6127c189-db9f-4e95-9188-7a881de05fd8" label="lyrics-like">in terram, vidérunt prunas pósitas,</l><l xml:id="m-35265390-46f8-45e0-a171-af3c4b75c7da" facs="#m-174956b1-4fce-43e1-986c-d20d20a10484" label="ambiguous">eius duo. Dicit eis Simon Petrus:</l><l xml:id="m-d7d4b6e4-7515-44ac-bd84-16a1d9c9bec0" facs="#m-b2823220-2ca3-4f48-8d62-a613effbd109" label="lyrics-like">et piscem superpósitum, et panem.</l><l xml:id="m-120bf8b4-decf-43b3-a245-cb5933b153e6" facs="#m-39870da1-a53f-47f3-bf58-1595b9682110" label="lyrics-like">Vado piscári. Dicunt ei : Venimus</l><l xml:id="m-9b05c4a8-0112-479a-b655-825530ea5725" facs="#m-8624f18f-bece-4f09-b20b-8a15e4946088" label="lyrics-like">Dicit eis Jesus : Afférte de plscibus,</l><l xml:id="m-d401b6fa-1e41-4023-8b0e-73ccd7d3d787" facs="#m-f537ab39-3419-400e-8da2-76dedfd5e5ec" label="lyrics-like">et nos tecum. Et exiérunt, et ascen¬</l><l xml:id="m-317698b7-3f6d-499e-a84c-bbb070364cd2" facs="#m-9af1ab65-e2b2-41f8-ba9b-bf942cf8f3e2" label="lyrics-like">quos prendidístis nunc. Ascéndit</l><l xml:id="m-3067fbbc-6d0a-46a8-ad09-d20365b74ef5" facs="#m-4d12b50a-d22e-463a-bec1-91d67e598370" label="lyrics-like">dérunt in navim: et illa nocte nihil</l><l xml:id="m-9a5f0506-b8d5-485e-8369-e0aa51b361fa" facs="#m-5541e9b4-4d0a-4e5a-8f5f-78c6d46d04e3" label="ambiguous">Simon Petrus, et traxit rete in ter¬</l><l xml:id="m-c55dd6bb-3e11-4260-9ed0-cfba2f316de1" facs="#m-93851407-7181-45c7-9c64-65f8a06aa5d3" label="lyrics-like">prendidérunt. Mane autem facto,</l><l xml:id="m-ab817b5d-f47a-4ef8-8fc6-2c50da2f8731" facs="#m-23369ba8-94fe-4ab1-b765-cee9578dc313" label="lyrics-like">ram, plenum magnis píscibus cen¬</l><l xml:id="m-00796030-1788-470f-9fc4-fb7fca96f1c7" facs="#m-e273f58b-abb5-4227-8783-d40880668a20" label="ambiguous">tum quinquaginta tribus. Et cum</l><l xml:id="m-92bf7f87-8ee0-427d-95fb-5cfc39f46b9d" facs="#m-c2c15a95-940b-4021-84e3-9e1979b80490" label="ambiguous">stetit Jesus in littore: non tamen</l><l xml:id="m-7cd4681b-ac2b-44ba-8611-ec85e8e4b994" facs="#m-3af799d9-0d18-4d4c-95a4-bf82ca8a025f" label="lyrics-like">cognovérunt discipuli quia Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-e197ee92-124d-494b-a75d-09eef0681a0f" facs="#m-af9d4ac2-3461-4fbb-acfa-d193f1611931" label="ambiguous">tanti essent, non est scissum rete.</l><l xml:id="m-4d979728-8523-4605-bde2-0269992fdf79" facs="#m-56af04ea-a523-41e4-8a20-98f1bab2ba16" label="ambiguous">est Dixit ergo eis Jesus: Pueri,</l><l xml:id="m-faa03d8a-2205-45c6-852f-647f0fb4ae0b" facs="#m-1c778541-883e-4d37-a8b3-674f153f560c" label="lyrics-like">Dicit eis Jesus: Venste, prandéte.</l><l xml:id="m-a9525d0c-fa92-4dc6-bdc5-e7993cf210cd" facs="#m-d3cd0ce7-3b69-4860-9e9b-a90a42d320db" label="lyrics-like">Et nemo audébat discumbéntium</l><l xml:id="m-747cfd7b-66ac-4bc8-9787-eb9d87f653df" facs="#m-f9da1d9b-56b8-492c-81ec-ad23a1da252f" label="lyrics-like">numquid pulmentárium habétis?</l><l xml:id="m-fa85b674-0267-4a2d-be35-77c0c59b94e5" facs="#m-d5d3a616-4c7b-41d0-965e-88158d631995" label="lyrics-like">Respondérunt ei: Non. Dicit eis:</l><l xml:id="m-73c05074-a73e-436e-b3ff-9f9b5ce9e49c" facs="#m-518bca9e-19b3-4a9b-927f-acc22e0c8f13" label="lyrics-like">interrogáre eum: Tu quis es?</l><l xml:id="m-82349176-ed0b-47f1-b0c1-9ae0d36c2058" facs="#m-0139ce1b-3063-4fea-ada3-1d2cae779352" label="lyrics-like">Mittite in déxteram navigii rete,</l><l xml:id="m-4666f10a-1832-4d38-bbbc-ca1f28f3c103" facs="#m-35fd3caf-2a5a-4f1d-82e8-da407e181ede" label="lyrics-like">sciéntes, quia Dóminus est. Et</l><l xml:id="m-7158d9b6-483c-45a5-8370-390e3689375d" facs="#m-4614dd9e-9a84-41b6-9227-ab0e2fba3a76" label="lyrics-like">et inveniétis. Misérunt ergo: t</l><l xml:id="m-95df411b-156d-4d46-a11b-78513e518278" facs="#m-4de01dfc-7c3d-4881-9ac8-0e329f1ce8b0" label="lyrics-like">venit Jesus, et áccipit panem, et</l><l xml:id="m-50c547cd-6492-43c6-900a-fb994b3bbf0c" facs="#m-c746b918-16be-463c-9cb3-df49f31d4a35" label="lyrics-like">jam non valébant illud tráhere prae</l><l xml:id="m-2e153ce1-477d-419c-a0dc-52518e8bbe98" facs="#m-95f47d91-2484-4488-9e4b-c57d13ce0b2d" label="ambiguous">dat eis, et piscem similiter. Hoc</l><l xml:id="m-6fbd8ebd-bd2f-47f8-9bf6-7413ecbd8590" facs="#m-a7fb2fc2-c3e0-44b2-88e6-1441b9cbc901" label="lyrics-like">multitúdine piscium. Dixit ergo</l><l xml:id="m-5ba6033a-b73e-4b6b-af72-fc0a997d6ff1" facs="#m-1436b051-2a60-4b70-8c3a-dd52a4071d1e" label="lyrics-like">jam tértio manifestátus est Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-e6927aba-b45f-4a8b-8fef-f5ec651ad5f5" facs="#m-6cd40bf3-6690-4626-99a6-916b10942d1d" label="lyrics-like">discipulus ille, quem diligébat</l><l xml:id="m-61680f9e-3639-4526-ad20-78b8a428837e" facs="#m-815d4c04-d76a-47f6-a868-b39acdb974bf" label="lyrics-like">discípulis suis, cum resurrexísset a</l><l xml:id="m-2314af46-a66e-4f25-a520-5317d4166141" facs="#m-bc7fda48-1f96-40f7-ab1e-1615c8a7b8a6" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-262d80fa-1671-422b-b7ff-79398fa4cdc2" facs="#m-e8bf1ca8-8a60-4352-8628-f009abf2905c" label="lyrics-like">Jesus, Petro: Dóminus est. Simon</l><l xml:id="m-1eb140a5-3f1b-4c27-b680-c46acb625ac1" facs="#m-18a4dc7a-77dc-43f6-a3a0-35a3c0196408" label="lyrics-like">mórtuis.</l><l xml:id="m-f5897740-7458-4e76-9516-81baa2b7620f" facs="#m-9be69466-03a0-4ad7-a564-15f2d4d54c8d" label="lyrics-like">Petrus cum audisset quia Dóminus</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>